  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SIMBA (Skills and Innovation for Micro Banking in Africa) - Africa Regional Department contribution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity SIMBA (Skills and Innovation for Micro Banking in Africa) - Africa Regional Department contribution is a component of SIMBA (Skills &amp; Innovation for Micro Banking in Africa) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;1,507,748. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Formal sector financial intermediaries, Financial policy and administrative management, Informal/semi-formal financial intermediaries, Education/training in banking and financial services.</narrative>
  </description>
